                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                        "entry_id": "dbe818eb-4800-30f3-ac0e-6942f748768d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An atmosphere or aura felt to belong to a person, place or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "informal",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c46e98e8-027d-486f-ad3d-fc67f624c20e",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "The couple canceled their night out when they got a bad vibe from the new babysitter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "166ce692-ba31-445a-b7f6-82b5984040e7",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "As I passed the stables and thanked the caretaker, I sensed nasty vibes. It was time to go."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dddd0ec-7e0e-4d1c-8758-50e84f2a8bc8",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "I like her. I get good vibes from her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e752a271-a9dd-477f-b4f8-546c75a6bce3",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "This place is giving me bad vibes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "578b7cb0-3347-4262-94af-5deabc3970e9",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "I have no problem with nudity. I'm, like, a total nudist. But that's just not my vibe, artistry-wise. A little mystery goes a long way for me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6995e6c0-1de5-4305-8e54-5296f47e513f",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "I'll put up a fight, taking out my earrings\nDon't you know the vibe? Don't you know the feeling?\nYou should spend the night, catch me on your ceiling\nThat's your prize, that's your prize\nWell"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4105d5b8-7089-4c89-96ab-128500964735",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7b35d0-23fb-31e3-ba2a-a1fb8920cbc8",
                                                "text": "OpenAI reportedly gave GPT-4o the system prompt to “match the user’s vibe.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d2f4cd9-3cae-3be5-becd-cfe558016329",
                                        "entry_id": "dbe818eb-4800-30f3-ac0e-6942f748768d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is good, trendy, pleasant, or atmospheric; a thing or person with a good vibe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c5447c9-4274-4468-9559-40bd696ed6ec",
                                                "sense_id": "1d2f4cd9-3cae-3be5-becd-cfe558016329",
                                                "text": "Once inside, Clayton wasted no time testing his chemistry with the women, kissing Teddi, Kira, Eliza, Cassidy and Rachel. However, not all of his relationships were so easy — Claire announced to the other contestants that her one-on-one time with Clayton was “not the vibe,” noting that he was too nice for her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a048cf7-37fd-4400-b11a-73a35470af4d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d2f4cd9-3cae-3be5-becd-cfe558016329",
                                                "text": "I’ve noticed my attitude just hasn’t been the vibe lately. Yesterday I totally lost it at a restaurant because my pasta was only 18 C, which is two degrees below normal room temperature—like two degrees! How could they?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d26d67-f6f4-420e-bbef-062dbfc8547d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d2f4cd9-3cae-3be5-becd-cfe558016329",
                                                "text": "“I didn’t know how to feel. I was a little bit shocked, to be honest,” Brown says. “It was not the vibe, you know what I mean? That’s the way I always describe it. It was not good vibes.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb25f554-8db4-44bc-a7bf-abc6e0bc7df3",
                                                "sense_id": "1d2f4cd9-3cae-3be5-becd-cfe558016329",
                                                "text": "Substack certainly knows this. It tried to raise last year, seeking $75 million to $100 million from investors. But it had revenue of only $9 million in 2021, and a sky-high valuation on relatively little revenue was not the vibe in 2022. The company gave up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99267c2a-a75d-3158-ada5-990a23bdb346",
                                        "entry_id": "dbe818eb-4800-30f3-ac0e-6942f748768d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vibraphone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "plural",
